'''Public Speaking Demon''' is a mob that spawns during the [[Great Spook (event)|Great Spook event]] after the death of a {{MobSprite|Primal Fear}}.

== Behavior ==
Unlike other {{MobSprite|Primal Fear}}s, the '''Public Speaking Demon''' spawns in a group of 5. They will walk slowly toward the player once spawned, dealing {{Stat|dmg|1}}. They have {{Stat|hp|5}} and like [[Spooky Mobs]], take only {{Stat|Damage|1}} per hit. Upon reaching {{stat|hp|1}}, they encourage the player to speak, with which the player must comply to be able to damage the '''Public Speaking Demon''' again. The message must be at least ten characters long.

